OL,3,GNEWSAPoliticians back focus on cost of
OL,4,Aliving
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoliticians have backed the Government
OL,7,Fof Jersey's key priorities for the next
OL,8,Fpolitical term which includes action on
OL,9,Fthe cost of living.
OL,11,FStates members adopted the Common
OL,12,FStrategic Policy which lays out the
OL,13,FCouncil of Ministers' priorities for
OL,14,Fthe political term until 2030.
OL,16,FThe priorities are centered around four
OL,17,Fpillars including targeted action on
OL,18,Fthe cost of living, restoring Jersey's
OL,19,Fcompetitiveness, investing in homes and
OL,20,Finfrastructure and maintaining
OL,21,Ffinancial stability.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
