OL,3,GNEWSAPoliticians back focus on cost of
OL,4,Aliving
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief Minister Lyndon Farnham said the
OL,7,Fgovernment was determined "to make
OL,8,FJersey a more affordable place to live"
OL,9,Fbut Reform Jersey co-leader Lyndsay
OL,10,FFeltham said the policy lacked "real
OL,11,Faction".
